       Art redo (cast bible §4, folded in from the_contagion.md's Owed section): half
       PLANT, alien on BOTH halves, never a half oak. Art: RM_HalfmadeTree, generated
       fresh through the pipeline (not the retired halfalientree_v1 render), validated
       pass. Poor-yield wood harvest, matching the donor's own halved-value shape. -->
